---
id: repo.update-documentation
title: Update Documentation
category: documentation
stage: [execute, discover, inspect, analyze, validate, report]
purpose: Align durable user, developer, or operator documentation with verified repository behavior.
inputs: [documentation_goal, audience, scope]
outputs: [updated_documentation, validation_report]
mutates_repository: true
